          "timestamp": "2026-11-18T14:53:29-07:00",
          "message": "fix(config): each load builds its installed-plugin layer, and nothing keeps one past it (70xn) (#830)\n\n* fix(config): a checkout's installed-plugin layer is held only by the render states that loaded it (70xn)\n\n* fix(config): a load takes the installed layer as a value its caller builds, so a click's loads share one, and plugins are laid over a base one way (70xn)\n\n* fix(config): a load builds its installed layer from its own snapshot again, so no caller can pair a snapshot with another's layer (70xn)\n\n* fix(config): the installed layer's comments claim only what the load and the install do (70xn)"
        }
      ]
